  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">South Sudan Red Cross (SSRC) National Society Development in Community Engagement and Accountability (CEA)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Juba, South Sudan</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="3">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">South Sudan Red Cross</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project is part of the SSRC National Society Development initiative funded through the NLRC-MoFA 2022-2026 partnership and focuses on National Society capacity strengthening. The initiative in South Sudan contains of two components: CEA (this project) and FS (see project number PRJ13-192-0008), and PSEA training.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Through setting-up a two-way community feedback mechanism, strengthening SSRC HR capacity on CEA,, and developing CEA strategy and SoPs to ensure CEA mainstreaming after project ends.</narrative>
  </description>
